    "title": "Identity Check and Validation Solution - NHS login",
    "description": "It has come to the attention of NHS England that the original 'Value of Contract' figure included in the Contract Notice for this NHS Login Identity Check and Validation Solution (Identity Check and Validation Solution - NHS login - Contracts Finder) for the contract publication included an incorrect value.\r\n\r\nThe accurate 'Total Value of Contract' figure is £5,159,553.29 ex VAT. This value includes the initial three year committed term and the value of the one year optional extension.\r\n\r\nEnables users to prove their identity which links them to their health record and subsequently enables access to digital services using a simple, consistent, and secure process via a trusted service.",
